WEBVTT

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:31.375
So the question is, how do we do it?

00:00:32.292 --> 00:00:33.851
How do we manage to grab

00:00:33.875 --> 00:00:37.708
an ever-increasing share
of the economic pie every year?

00:00:38.875 --> 00:00:42.792
Is it that rich people are smarter
than we were 30 years ago?

00:00:43.833 --> 00:00:46.208
Is it that we're working harder
than we once did?

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:50.000
Are we taller, better looking?

00:00:51.292 --> 00:00:52.542
Sadly, no.

00:00:53.542 --> 00:00:56.143
It all comes down to just one thing:

00:00:56.167 --> 00:00:57.417
economics.

00:00:58.250 --> 00:00:59.822
Because, here's the dirty secret.